      "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Đường tròn cắt đồ thị tại <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>. Ta có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> với <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>81</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/variant-assets/9361f902c3a75e820b66219c6f36be66be155462b1b00b59bcf9c01eb50ab6f6.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div></div>Đặt <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>sin</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, bảng đổi cận: <div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"tex-table\"><tbody><tr><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>x</mi></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>9</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt>